cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "DRIAMS — Federated AMR Prediction from MALDI-TOF Spectra"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for antimicrobial resistance prediction from MALDI-TOF mass
  spectra on the DRIAMS dataset: pooled logistic-regression, MLP and
  random-forest baselines, cross-site generalisation, multi-label
  classification and 1D CNN variants, and federated learning with Flower
  across four Swiss hospitals.
